      "question": "Does Buttondown support one-click unsubscribe?",
      "answer": "We sure do!\n\nWe use one-click unsubscribe headers (also known as `List-Unsubscribe` headers) in every email we send to make it easy for clients like Gmail to automatically detect and display an unsubscribe link in the email header.\n\nIf you're analyzing the headers of a _preview_ or draft email, you won't see the `List-Unsubscribe` header. This is because the header is only added when the email is sent out to your subscribers. Previews are technically [transactional](/glossary-managing-your-list#transactional-email) and don't get all the same headers appended to them as a regular newsletter email."
